OL,3,GNEWSAPacking firm to close plant with
OL,4,A165 job losses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major packaging company has confirmed
OL,7,Fit is closing a large box plant, which
OL,8,Fwill lead to 165 job losses.
OL,10,FInternational firm DS Smith began
OL,11,Fconsulting with employees earlier this
OL,12,Fyear at its site in Launceston in
OL,13,FCornwall, where it has been a
OL,14,Fsignificant local employer for nearly
OL,15,F60 years.
OL,17,FIt said the "difficult decision" to
OL,18,Fshut was made "after careful
OL,19,Fconsideration of counter proposals
OL,20,Fraised," adding production at the site
OL,21,Fwill finish in November.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
