OL,3,GNEWSAPacking firm to close plant with
OL,4,A165 job losses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company noted it recognised the
OL,7,Fdecision was "disappointing for those
OL,8,Fimpacted," adding it would support its
OL,9,Femployees "through this period".
